  "body": "This beautifully updated property offers comfort, convenience, and strong investment potential in a highly sought-after school zone.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\nRecently renovated with:\r\nBrand new carpet\r\nModern new kitchen\r\nNew toilet\r\nFresh interior paint in some rooms\r\nSunny 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom unit\r\nOpen-plan kitchen and living area\r\n\r\nPrivate outdoor space perfect for:\r\nBBQs\r\nMorning coffee\r\nRelaxing in the sun\r\nLarge single garage\r\nAdditional off-street parking\r\nLocated in a quiet block of only three units\r\n\r\nInvestment Highlights:\r\nNew fixed-term tenancy secured from 12 May\r\nTenanted for one year at $795 per week\r\nStable and strong rental return\r\nIdeal opportunity for investors seeking long-term value\r\nPremium Location\r\nRight next to Glendowie College\r\nWalking distance to St Heliers School\r\n\r\nIn zone for:\r\nSt Ignatius Catholic School\r\nBaradene College of the Sacred Heart\r\nClose to parks, cafes, shops, and public transport\r\nMinutes from St Heliers Village and the beach\r\n\r\nPerfect For:\r\nFirst-home buyers\r\nDownsizers\r\nInvestors looking for a low-maintenance property in a premium school zone\r\n\r\nWhy You'll Love It:\r\nLight-filled living spaces\r\nFamily-friendly location\r\nExcellent school zoning\r\nEasy-care lifestyle\r\nStrong rental income potential\r\nRare opportunity in a tightly held area\r\n\r\nDon't miss your chance to secure this fantastic property. Contact the agent today to arrange a viewing.",
